7,"Enets, Tundra | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/enh/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..SbO1zIaoxZAxhecHnGTBNXJPmAwvucVpWceBm8oO5f4,Tundra Enets is an endangered indigenous language of the Russian Federation. It belongs to the Uralic language family. The language is used as a first language by older adults only.,"Enets, Tundra",Uralic
