9,Enets language,https://grokipedia.com/page/Enets_language,"Enets is a Northern Samoyedic language of the Uralic family, spoken by the Enets people on the Taimyr Peninsula in northern Siberia, Russia, primarily along the east bank of the Lower Yenisei River.","Enets, Tundra",Uralic
